  "solution": {
    "text": "For wire vibrating under tension, the fundamental frequency is given by<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow></mfrac><mroot><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi></mroot></math>, Where T is tension and <math> <mi>&#956;</mi> </math> linear mass density of string<br />It is given that, when it is sounded with a tuning fork of frequency <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn></math> beats per second were heard<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow></mfrac><msqrt><mfrac><mn>225</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi></mfrac></msqrt></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow></mfrac><msqrt><mfrac><mn>256</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi></mfrac></msqrt></math> undefined<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>16</mn><mn>15</mn></mfrac><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>)</mo></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mn>15</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>90</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>96</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>186</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mn>H</mn><mn>z</mn></math>"
